              </?01M0WNC1M5FJ6DF472EH3NARBE>
              <Criterion #P3-T2-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0WNC1M68S9V7YBKZ5NTV193>
              Stage/write/fsync/publish/head-CAS fault injection, retry and fresh recovery converge to exact old or new heads/receipt/facts without mixed authority; compaction proof reconstructs retained facts and first-delivery provenance after pair removal without live reread, duplicate transition or fabricated observation.
              </?01M0WNC1M68S9V7YBKZ5NTV193>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion #P3-G1 { checked = true } ?01M0WNC1M68S9V7YBKZ5NTV194>
          Every non-extension final-wire change maps to one persisted supported epoch reason; an unreasoned change fails the product gate.
          </?01M0WNC1M68S9V7YBKZ5NTV194>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P4 { name = "Cross-provider cost, recovery and fresh verification" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 3 } (
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #P4-T1 { name = "Run cross-profile final-wire and fresh recovery matrix" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 0 } (
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P4-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0WNC1M68S9V7YBKZ5NTV195>
              DeepSeek official/compatible, OpenAI Chat, OpenAI Responses, Anthropic Messages and Claude Code final-body fixtures use the exact versioned role/container/cache-unit table, preserve typed-fact ordering and reject system hoisting, framing drift or illegal pair adjacency.
